+# Feature: createPatch(from, to)
+
+Returns an RFC 6902 JSON Patch turning `from` into `to`; inputs are not mutated and not aliased.
+
+- Minimal: objects diffed per member (recursively); only changed members appear.
+- Arrays: LCS on deep equality, so inserts/removals emit a single add/remove and a move emits a
+  remove plus an add; differing items at the same slot are diffed recursively.
+- Differing types/primitives produce a `replace` (path "" for the root).
+- Implemented in `src/diff.ts`, tested in `test/diff.test.ts` (including a randomised round-trip).
+
+Note: `.specify/memory/constitution.md` is still the unfilled template, so no project rules applied.
